Subject: All Of My Friends... What a great Dark Star! with an amazing jam out of the silence. I sure wish we had the transition into St. Stephen, but whatever, it's still a wave rider. And that fat Eleven for a new year present. Such fun! Just a great show all around. - January 2, 2012All Of My Friends...

