Tasty and creamy take on a ham sandwich!

Minutes to Prepare: 5 Minutes to Cook: 5 Number of Servings: 1

Ingredients

4 slices of reduced fat low sodium deli ham

2-3 tablespoons of fat free cream cheese

2 green onions diced

1 medium slice onion chopped

