“Idol Drama Operation Team” is Korea’s first mission variety program in which seven girl group members work together to write the script for their own drama and act in it. Their drama is titled “Let’s Walk the Flower Road” (tentative title), and the seven members are Red Velvet’s Seulgi, MAMAMOO’s Moonbyul, I.O.I’s Jeon Somi, CIVA’s Kim Sohee, Lovelyz’s Soojung, SONAMOO’s D.ana, and Oh My Girl’s YooA. Other celebrities who will appear in the drama are Im Won Hee, Jang Won Young, Shin Hyun Joon, Jun So Min, Kwon Oh Joong, Dynamic Duo, Kim Chungha, Kim Jong Min, and Hyerim.

